flowchart TD
    A[Defect detected] --> B[Capture BEFORE<br/>exact command + output]
    B --> C[Classify]
    C -->|AUTO-FIX| D[Source right fix<br/>§2 docs/repo/internet]
    C -->|GUARDED-FIX| E[Create undo path<br/>backup/VCS/dry-run]
    C -->|STOP candidate| F{Knowledge<br/>or authority?}
    E --> D

    F -->|Knowledge| G[§1.6 Search Loop]
    F -->|Authority| H[§8.6 Ledger<br/>then STOP]

    G --> D
    D --> I[Apply minimal fix<br/>root cause, no suppressors]
    I --> J[Re-run IDENTICAL detection]
    J --> K{Green?}
    K -->|No| L{Ledger<br/>complete?}
    K -->|Yes| M[Capture AFTER<br/>record row]
    L -->|No| G
    L -->|Yes| H
    M --> N[Next defect<br/>or Clean-Room]